# Role-scoped UI changes

Manager and Accountant share some routes but render different views.

- **Default:** only change the **Accountant** view (e.g. `ProfitabilityReport`, `ArAgingReport`, accountant branches in report `page.tsx`).
- **Do not** change Manager layouts (`ManagerProfitabilityView`, `ManagerArAgingView`, or manager branches) unless the user explicitly asks.
- When adding report features, gate them with `role === "accountant"` (or put them only in accountant components).
